+### Task 1.6: Finalizers (`UNINIT`) and weak references
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `rust/crates/rexx-core/src/heap.rs`, `src/body.rs`
+- Create: `rust/crates/rexx-core/tests/uninit.rs`
